{"step_index":233,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:57:00Z","thinking":"**Confirming Visual Assets**\n\nOkay, the first phase is complete. I've successfully generated the initial two SVG assets: `bin_blue_unbuckled` and `bin_yellow_unbuckled`. They are standalone, crystal sharp, and located as specified. Now, I will start to generate the remaining two combinations.\n\n\n**Designing State Manager**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in developing the character state manager in `js/app.js`, crafting the `updateCharacterImage()` method as the core. The initial logic for selecting the correct SVG asset based on `shirtColor` and `seatbelt` state has been fully implemented, and I am preparing for integration.\n\n\n**Implementing State Methods**\n\nI've added the `setShirtColor()` and `setSeatbelt()` methods to manage character state, triggering image updates and sound effects, and updating the UI accordingly. I'm now integrating these methods into the relevant UI components of levels 1 and 5, specifically linking color buttons to color changes and buckle interactions to seatbelt adjustments. I'm also preparing for the sound effects.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <div id=\"parent-prompt-avatar\" class=\"prompt-avatar-sprite speaker-mom\"></div>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI (ĐỔI TRỰC TIẾP HÌNH BÉ BIN THEO MÀU ÁO)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ quần áo chứa các món đồ lựa chọn -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet-art\">\n                        <!-- 1. Áo thun vàng (Soft - Đổi sang áo vàng) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" data-shirt-color=\"yellow\" aria-label=\"Áo thun vàng\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Áo thun vàng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Áo thun vàng</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 2. Áo thun xanh máy bay (Soft - Đổi sang áo xanh) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" data-shirt-color=\"blue\" aria-label=\"Áo thun xanh\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/objects/shirt_soft.svg\" class=\"item-img-art\" style=\"filter: hue-rotate(180deg);\" alt=\"Áo thun xanh\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Áo thun xanh</span>\n                        </button>\n                        \n                        <!-- 3. Quần bò cứng (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" d